    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d490">

                <pb facs="0614" n="534" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg534"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Loomis.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-01-16"><hi rendition="#italic">January 16,
                        1901.</hi></date></dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 379.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to acknowledge the receipt of your
                    No. 538, of the 29th ultimo, inclosing Mr. Russell’s statement concerning the
                    arrest of the United States cousular agent at Barcelona.</p>
                <p>You are instructed to inform the Venezuelan foreign office that Mr. Balz, who was
                    arrested without cause, reports that no explanation or apology was made when he
                    was released. You will call attention to the fact that Mr. Russell’s telegram to
                    the consular agent in reference to this matter was intercepted.</p>
                <p>This is not the first occasion upon which Mr. Balz has been subjected to the
                    arbitrary action of the Venezuelan local military leaders. <pb facs="0615"
                        n="535" xml:id="pg535"/> Although he is not a citizen of the United States,
                    this Government will protect him, while acting as its consular representative,
                    against the arbitrary interference of Venezuelan officials. You will insist that
                    adequate explanations and apologies be made to the consular agent, and that
                    proper measures be taken to prevent the recurrence of such acts.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
